+# One synchronous reset, the pin wg_rst, resets every register of the DUT and
+# of the resources both directions share (reset_registers=WG_REGS). Always
+# declared: with -D RESET=0 the clock has no reset, nothing uses wg_rst, and it
+# makes no port. Testbench MAINs keep the default "requested" policy.
